{
  "title": "15 Daily Life - I’m sorry, I love you",
  "audio": "./assets/englishpod_C0015pb.mp3",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Hello everyone and welcome back to another great lesson with EnglishPod.",
      "trans": "大家好，欢迎再次来到以英语为母语的课程。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.84
    },
    {
      "text": "My name is Marco.",
      "trans": "我的名字是Marco。",
      "start": 5.84,
      "end": 7.04
    },
    {
      "text": "And I'm Erica.",
      "trans": "我是艾瑞克。",
      "start": 7.04,
      "end": 8.040000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Erica, today we have a great intermediate lesson.",
      "trans": "英语：艾瑞克，今天我们有次级课程。",
      "start": 8.040000000000001,
      "end": 11.88
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "没错。",
      "start": 11.88,
      "end": 12.88
    },
    {
      "text": "We've got a lesson about love.",
      "trans": "我们有关于爱的课程。",
      "start": 12.88,
      "end": 14.88
    },
    {
      "text": "About love.",
      "trans": "关于爱。",
      "start": 14.88,
      "end": 16.080000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "And about apologizing.",
      "trans": "英语：And about apologizing.",
      "start": 16.080000000000002,
      "end": 17.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 18.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Love and apologizing.",
      "trans": "英语：爱和道歉。",
      "start": 18.68,
      "end": 20.04
    },
    {
      "text": "They go together.",
      "trans": "他们一起工作。",
      "start": 20.04,
      "end": 21.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes they do.",
      "trans": "是的，他们确实如此。",
      "start": 21.04,
      "end": 22.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Especially if you have a girlfriend or boyfriend, right?",
      "trans": "特别如果你们有女朋友或男朋友？",
      "start": 22.04,
      "end": 23.84
    },
    {
      "text": "That's true.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：“这就是正确的。”",
      "start": 23.84,
      "end": 24.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, so why don't we start by looking at our vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "好的，现在我们来回顾一下我们的词汇预览。",
      "start": 24.84,
      "end": 29.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Vocabulary preview.",
      "trans": "词汇预览。",
      "start": 30.0,
      "end": 32.56
    },
    {
      "text": "In today's vocabulary preview, we will learn two important words from our dialogue.",
      "trans": "今天在词汇预览中，我们将学习两个重要的词。",
      "start": 32.56,
      "end": 40.32
    },
    {
      "text": "What's the first word?",
      "trans": "第一个字是什么？",
      "start": 40.32,
      "end": 41.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Knock over.",
      "trans": "英语：摔倒。",
      "start": 41.92,
      "end": 43.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Knock over.",
      "trans": "英语：Knock over.",
      "start": 43.44,
      "end": 45.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Knock over.",
      "trans": "英语：Knock over.",
      "start": 45.32,
      "end": 46.519999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Knock over.",
      "trans": "英语：摔倒。",
      "start": 46.519999999999996,
      "end": 48.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's a really simple one when you knock something over.",
      "trans": "所以，这是一台非常简单的相机。",
      "start": 48.36,
      "end": 51.28
    },
    {
      "text": "You make it fall down.",
      "trans": "你把责任卸下了。",
      "start": 51.28,
      "end": 52.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it fall down.",
      "trans": "把责任卸下。",
      "start": 52.56,
      "end": 53.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Yep.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 53.56,
      "end": 54.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Speaking of knocking things over this morning.",
      "trans": "早上这个早晨，我碰翻了桌子。",
      "start": 54.56,
      "end": 58.8
    },
    {
      "text": "I knocked over my coffee cup all over my desk.",
      "trans": "我把我的咖啡杯打翻在了桌子上。",
      "start": 58.8,
      "end": 62.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I saw that.",
      "trans": "是的，我看到了。",
      "start": 62.16,
      "end": 63.16
    },
    {
      "text": "You almost ruined our lesson plan for today.",
      "trans": "英语：你几乎毁了今天的教学计划。",
      "start": 63.16,
      "end": 65.84
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 65.84,
      "end": 66.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I did.",
      "trans": "我做到了。",
      "start": 66.84,
      "end": 67.84
    },
    {
      "text": "It was all over the place.",
      "trans": "英语：It was all over the place.",
      "start": 67.84,
      "end": 69.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, let's look at our second word.",
      "trans": "好的，让我们看看我们的第二个单词。",
      "start": 69.64,
      "end": 72.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Explode.",
      "trans": "英语：爆炸。",
      "start": 72.32,
      "end": 73.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Explode.",
      "trans": "炸开。",
      "start": 73.32,
      "end": 74.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Explode.",
      "trans": "英语：爆炸。",
      "start": 74.32,
      "end": 75.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Explode.",
      "trans": "英语：爆炸。",
      "start": 75.32,
      "end": 76.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Explode.",
      "trans": "英语：爆炸。",
      "start": 76.32,
      "end": 77.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So when something explodes, this is what happens.",
      "trans": "所以，当发生爆炸时，这正是这种情况。",
      "start": 77.32,
      "end": 80.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, that's pretty clear.",
      "trans": "好的，那应该很清楚了。",
      "start": 80.44,
      "end": 90.67999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "That's more than clear, I think.",
      "trans": "那比清晰还要好，我认为。",
      "start": 90.67999999999999,
      "end": 92.6
    },
    {
      "text": "So now we've looked at our two vocabulary preview words for this dialogue, and we are",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英语句子。",
      "start": 92.6,
      "end": 97.12
    },
    {
      "text": "ready to listen to it for the first time.",
      "trans": "英语：准备好倾听它第一次。",
      "start": 97.12,
      "end": 101.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Wow, what's going on?",
      "trans": "英语：哇，怎么回事？",
      "start": 101.88,
      "end": 109.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch out!",
      "trans": "英语：小心！",
      "start": 109.64,
      "end": 110.64
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, watch where you're going.",
      "trans": "你好，你去哪里？",
      "start": 110.64,
      "end": 117.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh no, I'm so sorry.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，不行。",
      "start": 117.76,
      "end": 119.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you alright?",
      "trans": "英语：你没事吧？",
      "start": 119.68,
      "end": 120.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I don't know.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，我不知道。",
      "start": 120.72,
      "end": 122.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I feel terrible.",
      "trans": "我感到非常糟糕。",
      "start": 122.68,
      "end": 123.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I really didn't mean to knock you over.",
      "trans": "我本来是要把你撞倒的。",
      "start": 123.88,
      "end": 125.8
    },
    {
      "text": "My tire just exploded and I lost control of my bike.",
      "trans": "我的轮胎刚刚爆了，我失控了。",
      "start": 125.8,
      "end": 128.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Really, it was an accident.",
      "trans": "真的，那是个意外。",
      "start": 128.28,
      "end": 130.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Please accept my apologies.",
      "trans": "请接受我的歉意。",
      "start": 130.0,
      "end": 131.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Just let me try to stand up.",
      "trans": "请告诉我如何站立。",
      "start": 131.52,
      "end": 133.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, wait a second.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，等等。",
      "start": 133.52,
      "end": 155.56
    },
    {
      "text": "You seem really familiar.",
      "trans": "你似乎很熟悉。",
      "start": 155.56,
      "end": 156.72
    },
    {
      "text": "I think I know you're from somewhere.",
      "trans": "我猜你来自哪里。",
      "start": 156.72,
      "end": 159.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's right.",
      "trans": "是的，那正是。",
      "start": 159.0,
      "end": 160.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we've met somewhere before.",
      "trans": "我猜我们曾经在某个地方见过面。",
      "start": 160.04000000000002,
      "end": 162.12
    },
    {
      "text": "We met at Aaron's place last weekend.",
      "trans": "我们上周在阿东的家里见面。",
      "start": 162.12,
      "end": 164.24
    },
    {
      "text": "What a coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：What a coincidence.",
      "start": 164.24,
      "end": 165.96
    },
    {
      "text": "But anyway, I'm glad to see you're not badly hurt and I should probably get going.",
      "trans": "但是，我倒是觉得你没事，应该赶紧走。",
      "start": 165.96,
      "end": 169.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I've got an 9 o'clock meeting.",
      "trans": "我有9点钟的会议。",
      "start": 169.44,
      "end": 171.20000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's my number.",
      "trans": "但是这里是我的号码。",
      "start": 171.20000000000002,
      "end": 173.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Call me and we'll exchange insurance information.",
      "trans": "请让我知道，我们将在保险到期时交换信息。",
      "start": 173.12,
      "end": 175.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I heard.",
      "trans": "我听到。",
      "start": 175.08,
      "end": 176.08
    },
    {
      "text": "My ankle.",
      "trans": "我的脚。",
      "start": 176.08,
      "end": 177.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it's broken.",
      "trans": "我感觉它坏了。",
      "start": 177.08,
      "end": 178.44
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't just leave me like this.",
      "trans": "你不能就这样离开我。",
      "start": 178.44,
      "end": 186.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you calling an ambulance?",
      "trans": "英语：你是不是在叫救护车？",
      "start": 186.36,
      "end": 188.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope.",
      "trans": "抱歉。",
      "start": 188.08,
      "end": 189.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Definitely my appointment so that I can stay here with you.",
      "trans": "绝对是我的安排，以便能在这里与您一起。",
      "start": 189.08,
      "end": 217.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I love happy endings.",
      "trans": "我爱幸福结局。",
      "start": 217.96,
      "end": 220.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Such a romantic dialogue.",
      "trans": "这样的对话非常浪漫。",
      "start": 220.36,
      "end": 222.04000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, this guy.",
      "trans": "是的，这是这个家伙。",
      "start": 222.04000000000002,
      "end": 223.20000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh my God, he is amazing.",
      "trans": "英语：Oh my God, he is amazing.",
      "start": 223.20000000000002,
      "end": 225.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I would love to meet a guy like that.",
      "trans": "我愿意和一个像他那样的男人见面。",
      "start": 225.08,
      "end": 227.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Like that?",
      "trans": "是的，像这样？",
      "start": 227.56,
      "end": 228.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Like crashing into you?",
      "trans": "英语：像撞向你一样。",
      "start": 228.56,
      "end": 230.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe not like that.",
      "trans": "英语：也许不太像那个。",
      "start": 230.08,
      "end": 231.92000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, well, I think it's time to look at some of language in this dialogue.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请继续提供需要翻译的英文内容。",
      "start": 231.92000000000002,
      "end": 236.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's start with our language takeaway.",
      "trans": "让我们从我们的语言总结开始。",
      "start": 236.68,
      "end": 241.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Language takeaway.",
      "trans": "语言总结。",
      "start": 241.96,
      "end": 244.20000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Today we have three important words from our dialogue that we will learn for our language",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 244.2,
      "end": 250.83999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "takeaway.",
      "trans": "卸下。",
      "start": 250.83999999999997,
      "end": 252.11999999999998
    },
    {
      "text": "The first word is familiar.",
      "trans": "第一个单词熟悉。",
      "start": 252.11999999999998,
      "end": 254.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Familiar.",
      "trans": "熟悉。",
      "start": 254.92,
      "end": 255.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Familiar.",
      "trans": "熟悉。",
      "start": 255.92,
      "end": 256.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Familiar.",
      "trans": "熟悉。",
      "start": 256.92,
      "end": 258.24
    },
    {
      "text": "This one I think is a little bit hard to explain.",
      "trans": "这个镜头有点难看。",
      "start": 258.24,
      "end": 260.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so let's listen to some examples on how we use familiar.",
      "trans": "是的，那我们听听我们如何使用熟悉的。",
      "start": 260.76,
      "end": 266.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 1.",
      "trans": "示例 1。",
      "start": 266.52,
      "end": 270.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Norman Clark.",
      "trans": "诺曼·克拉克。",
      "start": 270.52,
      "end": 271.84
    },
    {
      "text": "That name sounds familiar.",
      "trans": "这个名字听起来很熟悉。",
      "start": 271.84,
      "end": 273.59999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Where have I heard it before?",
      "trans": "英语：Where have I heard it before?",
      "start": 273.6,
      "end": 277.96000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 2.",
      "trans": "例 2。",
      "start": 277.96000000000004,
      "end": 282.20000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "Do you know where we are?",
      "trans": "英语：你在哪里？",
      "start": 282.20000000000005,
      "end": 283.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I have no idea.",
      "trans": "我什么都不知道。",
      "start": 283.44,
      "end": 285.52000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing looks familiar.",
      "trans": "无从说起。",
      "start": 285.52000000000004,
      "end": 286.52000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we're lost.",
      "trans": "我感觉我们迷路了。",
      "start": 286.52000000000004,
      "end": 291.16
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 3.",
      "trans": "Example 3: 请卸下任务责任。",
      "start": 291.16,
      "end": 295.0
    },
    {
      "text": "You look really familiar.",
      "trans": "你看起来很熟悉。",
      "start": 295.0,
      "end": 296.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Did we go to high school together?",
      "trans": "英语：我们一起去上学吧。",
      "start": 296.0,
      "end": 301.16
    },
    {
      "text": "So when something's familiar, you think you know it, but you're not exactly sure.",
      "trans": "英语：所以当你熟悉某物时，你认为自己知道它，但实际上并不完全清楚。",
      "start": 301.16,
      "end": 307.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 307.8,
      "end": 308.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Familiar.",
      "trans": "熟悉。",
      "start": 308.8,
      "end": 309.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 309.8,
      "end": 310.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Our next word is.",
      "trans": "我们的下一个词是。",
      "start": 310.8,
      "end": 312.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Place.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"place\" 的翻译是 \"位置\"。",
      "start": 312.64000000000004,
      "end": 313.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Place.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"place\" 的翻译是 \"位置\"。",
      "start": 313.64000000000004,
      "end": 314.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Place.",
      "trans": "在中文中，\"place\" 的翻译是 \"位置\"。",
      "start": 314.64000000000004,
      "end": 315.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "Aaron's Place.",
      "trans": "阿奥的家。",
      "start": 315.64000000000004,
      "end": 317.44000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正好。",
      "start": 317.44000000000005,
      "end": 318.44000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "So when we refer to place, we refer to house.",
      "trans": "所以当我们提到位置时，我们指的是房子。",
      "start": 318.44000000000005,
      "end": 321.44000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”的翻译：",
      "start": 321.44000000000005,
      "end": 322.44000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "So I can say, hey, Marco, come over to my place for dinner tonight.",
      "trans": "所以，我可以说，嘿，马科，今晚来我家吃饭吧。",
      "start": 322.44000000000005,
      "end": 326.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确翻译为中文是：“正好。”",
      "start": 326.24,
      "end": 327.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's say we're having a party at my place tonight at 8.",
      "trans": "让我们今晚在你家聚会吧，时间是晚上八点。",
      "start": 327.24,
      "end": 331.52
    },
    {
      "text": "You might ask someone, how is your new place?",
      "trans": "英语：你可能问，你的新地方怎么样？",
      "start": 331.52,
      "end": 334.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 334.32,
      "end": 335.32
    },
    {
      "text": "How's your new apartment?",
      "trans": "你好，你的新公寓怎么样？",
      "start": 335.32,
      "end": 336.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "trans": "正确答案是：Exactly.",
      "start": 336.32,
      "end": 337.32
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a good one.",
      "trans": "那是一台好设备。",
      "start": 337.32,
      "end": 338.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So place.",
      "trans": "所以，请问您有什么问题？",
      "start": 338.32,
      "end": 339.32
    },
    {
      "text": "It's a house.",
      "trans": "它是一间房子。",
      "start": 339.32,
      "end": 340.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 340.32,
      "end": 341.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Our final word today is.",
      "trans": "今天的最后一句话是：我们的最终单词是。",
      "start": 341.32,
      "end": 343.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：巧合。",
      "start": 343.32,
      "end": 344.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：巧合。",
      "start": 344.32,
      "end": 345.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：巧合。",
      "start": 345.32,
      "end": 346.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：巧合。",
      "start": 346.32,
      "end": 347.32
    },
    {
      "text": "So again, we have some great examples for you to understand how we use coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：所以，再次给你们一些你们能理解的案例来了解我们如何使用巧合。",
      "start": 347.32,
      "end": 355.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 1.",
      "trans": "示例 1。",
      "start": 355.32,
      "end": 358.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to New York this weekend.",
      "trans": "我打算本周六去纽约。",
      "start": 358.4,
      "end": 360.64
    },
    {
      "text": "What a coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：What a coincidence.",
      "start": 360.64,
      "end": 361.64
    },
    {
      "text": "I am too.",
      "trans": "我太。",
      "start": 361.64,
      "end": 365.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 2.",
      "trans": "示例 2。",
      "start": 365.48,
      "end": 368.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "By coincidence, everyone in the room was named Alex.",
      "trans": "由巧合，房间里每个人的名字都是阿历克斯。",
      "start": 368.71999999999997,
      "end": 376.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Example 3.",
      "trans": "Example 3: 请卸下任务责任。",
      "start": 376.52,
      "end": 380.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We met by pure coincidence.",
      "trans": "我们是偶然相遇的。",
      "start": 380.44,
      "end": 382.76
    },
    {
      "text": "One day we ran into each other on our bikes and we've been together ever since.",
      "trans": "一天我们骑自行车相遇，从此就一直在一起。",
      "start": 382.76,
      "end": 389.24
    },
    {
      "text": "A coincidence is something that happens by chance, right?",
      "trans": "英语：巧合是随机发生的，对吗？",
      "start": 389.24,
      "end": 392.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 392.4,
      "end": 393.4
    },
    {
      "text": "You didn't plan it.",
      "trans": "你没有计划。",
      "start": 393.4,
      "end": 394.4
    },
    {
      "text": "It just happened.",
      "trans": "英语：它刚刚发生。",
      "start": 394.4,
      "end": 395.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 395.4,
      "end": 396.4
    },
    {
      "text": "These funny little things happen all the time.",
      "trans": "这些有趣的事情总是发生的。",
      "start": 396.4,
      "end": 397.4
    },
    {
      "text": "I love it when these coincidences happen.",
      "trans": "我非常喜欢这些巧合。",
      "start": 397.4,
      "end": 399.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, they're great.",
      "trans": "是的，他们很好。",
      "start": 399.71999999999997,
      "end": 401.52
    },
    {
      "text": "So Erica, why don't you tell us about a coincidence that's happened to you?",
      "trans": "英语：所以埃里卡，你为什么不告诉我们一下你遇到的巧合呢？",
      "start": 401.52,
      "end": 406.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, the other night I was having dinner in a restaurant and I looked up and I saw",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 406.2,
      "end": 412.4
    },
    {
      "text": "my old professor from university.",
      "trans": "我的老教授从大学。",
      "start": 413.32,
      "end": 416.2
    },
    {
      "text": "It was such a coincidence because here we are in Shanghai and I see my professor from",
      "trans": "在这里，我们正在上海。我看到我的教授。",
      "start": 416.2,
      "end": 421.03999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Canada having dinner at the table next to me.",
      "trans": "加拿大在我桌子旁边吃晚饭。",
      "start": 421.03999999999996,
      "end": 424.0
    },
    {
      "text": "It was such a coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：It was such a coincidence.",
      "start": 424.0,
      "end": 425.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "That is a coincidence.",
      "trans": "这是巧合。",
      "start": 425.47999999999996,
      "end": 426.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 426.47999999999996,
      "end": 427.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Or has it ever happened to you that you're thinking of someone and that person calls you?",
      "trans": "英语：或者你曾经考虑过某人，那个人后来打电话给你。",
      "start": 427.47999999999996,
      "end": 431.44
    },
    {
      "text": "That happens all the time.",
      "trans": "这句话的中文翻译是：",
      "start": 431.44,
      "end": 433.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a coincidence.",
      "trans": "那是一个巧合。",
      "start": 433.47999999999996,
      "end": 434.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 434.47999999999996,
      "end": 435.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 435.47999999999996,
      "end": 436.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 436.47999999999996,
      "end": 437.47999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "We have learned these three language takeaway words.",
      "trans": "我们已经学习了这三种语言的取意。",
      "start": 437.48,
      "end": 441.20000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "We can listen to our dialogue a second time, but this time it's going to be slower.",
      "trans": "我们可以在第二遍听对话时进行一次调整，但这次会更慢。",
      "start": 441.20000000000005,
      "end": 446.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, watch where you're going.",
      "trans": "你好，你去哪里？",
      "start": 446.48,
      "end": 452.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, no.",
      "trans": "英语：啊，不。",
      "start": 452.32,
      "end": 453.52000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm so sorry.",
      "trans": "我非常抱歉。",
      "start": 453.52000000000004,
      "end": 455.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you all right?",
      "trans": "英语：你没事吧？",
      "start": 455.24,
      "end": 456.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, I don't know.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，我不知道。",
      "start": 456.56,
      "end": 459.28000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "I feel terrible.",
      "trans": "我感到非常糟糕。",
      "start": 459.28000000000003,
      "end": 461.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I didn't mean to knock you over.",
      "trans": "我无意中撞到了你。",
      "start": 461.24,
      "end": 463.64000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "My tire just exploded and I lost control of my bike.",
      "trans": "我的轮胎刚刚爆了，我失控了我的自行车。",
      "start": 463.64,
      "end": 467.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Really, it was an accident.",
      "trans": "真的，那是个意外。",
      "start": 467.32,
      "end": 470.0
    },
    {
      "text": "Please accept my apologies.",
      "trans": "请接受我的歉意。",
      "start": 470.0,
      "end": 472.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Just let me try to stand up.",
      "trans": "请告诉我如何站立。",
      "start": 472.28,
      "end": 474.56
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, wait a second.",
      "trans": "英语：啊，等等。",
      "start": 474.56,
      "end": 477.08
    },
    {
      "text": "You seem really familiar.",
      "trans": "你好，你似乎很熟悉。",
      "start": 477.08,
      "end": 479.71999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "I think I know you from somewhere.",
      "trans": "我猜你从哪儿认识我。",
      "start": 479.71999999999997,
      "end": 482.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 482.4,
      "end": 483.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we have met somewhere before.",
      "trans": "我猜我们曾经在某个地方见过面。",
      "start": 483.68,
      "end": 487.15999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "英语：That's right.",
      "start": 487.15999999999997,
      "end": 488.15999999999997
    },
    {
      "text": "We met at Aaron's place last weekend.",
      "trans": "我们上周在阿东的家里碰面。",
      "start": 488.15999999999997,
      "end": 491.08
    },
    {
      "text": "What a coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：What a coincidence.",
      "start": 491.08,
      "end": 492.91999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "But anyway, I'm glad to see that you're not badly hurt and I should probably get going.",
      "trans": "但是，我倒是觉得你没事，应该赶紧开始吧。",
      "start": 492.92,
      "end": 498.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I have a 9 o'clock meeting.",
      "trans": "我有一个九点的会议。",
      "start": 498.32,
      "end": 501.08000000000004
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's my number.",
      "trans": "但是这里是我的号码。",
      "start": 501.08000000000004,
      "end": 502.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Call me and we'll exchange insurance information.",
      "trans": "联系我们，我们将交换保险信息。",
      "start": 502.72,
      "end": 505.72
    },
    {
      "text": "Ouch.",
      "trans": "英语：Ouch.",
      "start": 505.72,
      "end": 507.20000000000005
    },
    {
      "text": "My ankle.",
      "trans": "我的脚。",
      "start": 507.20000000000005,
      "end": 508.6
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it's broken.",
      "trans": "我感觉它坏了。",
      "start": 508.6,
      "end": 510.92
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't just leave me like this.",
      "trans": "你不能就这样离开我。",
      "start": 510.92,
      "end": 514.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you calling an ambulance?",
      "trans": "英语：你是不是在叫救护车？",
      "start": 514.6800000000001,
      "end": 517.28
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 517.28,
      "end": 518.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.",
      "trans": "我决定取消我的约会，以便在这里陪你。",
      "start": 518.28,
      "end": 527.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Well that was much clearer, wasn't it?",
      "trans": "英语：那可真是看得清清楚楚，不是吗？",
      "start": 527.92,
      "end": 529.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, that was clearer and this brings us to Fluency Builder.",
      "trans": "是的，那清晰多了，我们又来到了 Fluent Builder。",
      "start": 529.8,
      "end": 535.36
    },
    {
      "text": "Fluency Builder.",
      "trans": "流畅 builder.",
      "start": 535.36,
      "end": 536.88
    },
    {
      "text": "In today's Fluency Builder, we're going to show you different ways of apologizing.",
      "trans": "今天，我们将在Fluency Builder中展示不同方式的道歉。",
      "start": 536.88,
      "end": 542.12
    },
    {
      "text": "It's so important to be able to apologize well and fluently.",
      "trans": "英语：它很重要能很好地道歉和流利地说话。",
      "start": 542.12,
      "end": 548.24
    },
    {
      "text": "And you also want to say something different from I'm sorry.",
      "trans": "您还想说不同于我道歉的话。",
      "start": 548.24,
      "end": 551.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Right.",
      "trans": "正确。以下是“right”在中文中的翻译：",
      "start": 551.76,
      "end": 552.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's what we're going to show you today.",
      "trans": "所以今天我们将向您展示什么？",
      "start": 552.76,
      "end": 554.24
    },
    {
      "text": "We heard some great expressions for I'm sorry in the dialogue.",
      "trans": "我们听到了一些表达“对不起”在对话中的好词。",
      "start": 554.24,
      "end": 559.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's listen now.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 559.08,
      "end": 561.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm so sorry.",
      "trans": "我非常抱歉。",
      "start": 561.28,
      "end": 563.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "I feel terrible.",
      "trans": "我感到非常糟糕。",
      "start": 563.6800000000001,
      "end": 566.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Please accept my apologies.",
      "trans": "请接受我的歉意。",
      "start": 566.52,
      "end": 571.36
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm so sorry.",
      "trans": "我非常抱歉。",
