    },
    {
      "text": "Please accept my apologies.",
      "trans": "请接受我的歉意。",
      "start": 576.6,
      "end": 579.28
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah I feel terrible.",
      "trans": "英语：是的，我感到非常糟糕。",
      "start": 579.28,
      "end": 580.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I say this one all the time.",
      "trans": "我总是说这个。",
      "start": 580.96,
      "end": 582.6800000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah it's a great way of saying I'm sorry.",
      "trans": "是的，这真是一个很好的方式来表达我非常抱歉。",
      "start": 582.6800000000001,
      "end": 584.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Now also if you want to say I'm sorry, you also want to tell the person that you made",
