    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 620.9599999999999,
      "end": 622.9599999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "So all of these phrases are really useful and great for apologizing and telling someone",
      "trans": "所以这些短语真的非常有用和好用，非常适合道歉并告诉某人。",
      "start": 622.9599999999999,
      "end": 627.9599999999999
