    },
    {
      "text": "Oh.",
      "trans": "英语：哦。",
      "start": 691.52,
      "end": 692.52
    },
    {
      "text": "Wait a second.",
      "trans": "英语：等待一下。",
      "start": 692.52,
      "end": 693.52
    },
    {
      "text": "You seem really familiar.",
      "trans": "你好，你似乎很熟悉。",
      "start": 693.52,
      "end": 694.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I think I know you're from somewhere.",
      "trans": "我猜你来自哪里。",
      "start": 694.76,
      "end": 697.32
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, that's right.",
      "trans": "是的，那也是正确的。",
      "start": 697.32,
      "end": 698.32
    },
    {
      "text": "I think we've met somewhere before.",
      "trans": "我猜我们曾经相遇过。",
      "start": 698.32,
      "end": 700.08
    },
    {
      "text": "We met at Aaron's place last weekend.",
      "trans": "我们上周在阿东的家里见面。",
      "start": 700.08,
      "end": 702.08
    },
    {
      "text": "What a coincidence.",
      "trans": "英语：What a coincidence.",
      "start": 702.08,
      "end": 703.88
    },
    {
      "text": "But anyway, I'm glad to see you're not badly hurt and I should probably get going.",
      "trans": "但是，我倒是觉得你没事，应该赶紧走。",
      "start": 703.88,
      "end": 707.48
    },
    {
      "text": "I've got an 9 o'clock meeting.",
      "trans": "我有9点钟的会议。",
      "start": 707.48,
      "end": 710.12
    },
    {
      "text": "But here's my number.",
      "trans": "但是这里是我的号码。",
      "start": 710.12,
      "end": 711.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Call me and we'll exchange insurance information.",
      "trans": "联系我们，我们将交换保险信息。",
      "start": 711.12,
      "end": 713.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I heard.",
      "trans": "我听到。",
      "start": 713.12,
      "end": 714.12
    },
    {
      "text": "My ankle.",
      "trans": "我的脚。",
      "start": 714.12,
      "end": 715.12
    },
    {
      "text": "I think it's broken.",
      "trans": "我感觉它坏了。",
      "start": 715.12,
      "end": 716.44
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't just leave me like this.",
      "trans": "你不能就这样离开我。",
      "start": 716.44,
      "end": 717.96
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh.",
      "trans": "哦。",
      "start": 721.4,
      "end": 722.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Are you calling an ambulance?",
      "trans": "英语：你是不是在叫救护车？",
      "start": 722.4,
      "end": 726.24
    },
    {
      "text": "Nope.",
      "trans": "不。",
      "start": 726.24,
      "end": 727.24
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm canceling my appointment so that I can stay here with you.",
      "trans": "我决定取消我的约会，以便在这里陪你。",
      "start": 727.24,
      "end": 730.44
    },
    {
      "text": "We remember when we met last day.",
      "trans": "我们还记得上一次见面。",
      "start": 730.44,
      "end": 738.44
    },
    {
      "text": "I knew you were my friend.",
      "trans": "我认识你是我朋友。",
      "start": 738.44,
      "end": 741.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't tell you how much I love you.",
      "trans": "我不会告诉你我对你的爱有多深。",
      "start": 741.68,
      "end": 748.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Great dialogue and great music, right?",
      "trans": "好的对话和优美的音乐，对吗？",
      "start": 751.0,
      "end": 756.12
    },
    {
      "text": "Wonderful music.",
      "trans": "很好听的音乐。",
      "start": 756.12,
      "end": 757.12
    },
    {
      "text": "You picked that, Marco.",
      "trans": "你选那个，马科。",
      "start": 757.12,
      "end": 758.4
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course, me.",
      "trans": "当然，我。",
      "start": 758.4,
      "end": 759.92
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm a romantic type.",
      "trans": "我是个浪漫型。",
      "start": 759.92,
      "end": 761.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I love romantic music.",
      "trans": "我爱浪漫音乐。",
      "start": 761.08,
      "end": 762.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "trans": "真的？",
      "start": 762.48,
      "end": 763.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 763.48,
      "end": 764.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, speaking of a romantic type, do you believe in love at first sight?",
      "trans": "英语：嗯，说到浪漫类型，你是否相信爱恋从第一眼开始？",
      "start": 764.48,
      "end": 770.68
    },
    {
      "text": "I kind of do.",
      "trans": "我有点做。",
      "start": 770.68,
      "end": 772.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "trans": "真的？",
      "start": 772.08,
      "end": 773.08
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd like to believe it.",
      "trans": "我想要相信它。",
      "start": 773.08,
      "end": 774.08
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, that surprises me.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 774.08,
      "end": 777.2
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, I think the first time that you see someone, it impresses you some way.",
      "trans": "嗯，我认为第一次你看到别人时，会给你一种印象。",
      "start": 777.2,
      "end": 780.72
    },
    {
      "text": "You feel attracted to that person.",
      "trans": "你感觉对那个人有吸引力。",
      "start": 780.72,
      "end": 782.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "trans": "真的？",
      "start": 782.48,
      "end": 783.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 783.48,
      "end": 784.32
    },
    {
      "text": "At least it's the first feeling that you get that makes you want to talk to that person",
      "trans": "至少这让你第一次感觉到了，你想要和那个朋友说说话。",
      "start": 784.32,
      "end": 788.4
    },
    {
      "text": "or get to know that person.",
      "trans": "或者了解这个人的情况。",
      "start": 788.4,
      "end": 789.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I am the exact opposite.",
      "trans": "我就是这个。",
      "start": 789.84,
      "end": 791.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Really?",
      "trans": "真的？",
      "start": 791.44,
      "end": 792.44
    },
    {
      "text": "When I see somebody for the first time, my first impression is always wrong.",
      "trans": "英语：当我第一次见到某人时，我的第一印象总是不准确的。",
      "start": 792.44,
      "end": 797.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "trans": "英语：哦，好吧。",
      "start": 797.48,
      "end": 798.48
    },
    {
      "text": "So if I see someone and I like them at the beginning, in three weeks, I'll hate them.",
      "trans": "所以，如果我看到有人喜欢我，三个月后我会讨厌他们。",
      "start": 798.48,
      "end": 803.72
    },
    {
      "text": "And if I see someone and I don't like them when I first meet them, I'll be their best",
      "trans": "如果我第一次见到某人，我不喜欢他们，我会把他们当作我的好朋友。",
      "start": 803.72,
      "end": 807.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "friend.",
      "trans": "朋友。",
      "start": 807.8000000000001,
      "end": 808.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, yeah.",
      "trans": "是的，是的。",
      "start": 808.8000000000001,
      "end": 809.8000000000001
    },
    {
      "text": "But first sight doesn't work for me.",
      "trans": "但是第一次看到就不起作用。",
      "start": 809.8,
      "end": 811.5999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sure that our listeners have some stories that love at first sight.",
      "trans": "我保证我们的听众有一些关于第一次相遇的故事。",
      "start": 811.5999999999999,
      "end": 814.3199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Maybe they've met their wives or their boyfriends in this way.",
      "trans": "英语：或许他们已经见过他们的妻子或情人。",
      "start": 814.3199999999999,
      "end": 817.76
    },
    {
      "text": "I'd like to hear about it.",
      "trans": "我想要听听。",
      "start": 817.76,
      "end": 819.0799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Me too.",
      "trans": "我也是。",
      "start": 819.0799999999999,
      "end": 820.0799999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "And if anybody knows the name of the songs we used, also be sure to post it on the discussion",
      "trans": "并且如果有谁知道我们使用的歌曲的名字，也请务必在讨论区发布。",
      "start": 820.0799999999999,
      "end": 825.04
    },
    {
      "text": "board.",
      "trans": "板。",
      "start": 825.04,
      "end": 826.04
    },
    {
      "text": "That's right.",
      "trans": "英语：That's right.",
      "start": 826.04,
      "end": 827.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Our challenge for this week.",
      "trans": "我们的本周挑战。",
      "start": 827.04,
      "end": 828.04
    },
    {
      "text": "Our challenge for this lesson.",
      "trans": "我们的课程挑战。",
      "start": 828.04,
      "end": 829.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "trans": "是。",
      "start": 829.8,
      "end": 830.8
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's all for today, everyone.",
      "trans": "今天就到这里了，大家。",
      "start": 830.8,
      "end": 832.04
    },
    {
      "text": "But be sure to go to our website at EnglishPod.com.",
      "trans": "但是请务必访问我们的网站：https://englishpod.com。",
      "start": 832.04,
      "end": 836.0
    },
    {
      "text": "And as we said, leave all your comments, your stories, and see if you know the name of",
      "trans": "而且，我们说，离开所有的评论、故事和看看你是否知道这个人的名字。",
      "start": 836.0,
      "end": 840.6
    },
    {
      "text": "the songs.",
      "trans": "歌曲。",
      "start": 840.6,
      "end": 841.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "trans": "好的。",
      "start": 841.6,
      "end": 842.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, thanks for listening, everyone.",
      "trans": "好的，我明白了。请告诉我需要翻译的英文句子。",
      "start": 842.6,
      "end": 843.6
    },
    {
      "text": "And until next time, goodbye.",
      "trans": "英语：And until next time, goodbye.",
      "start": 843.6,
      "end": 845.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Goodbye.",
      "trans": "再见。",
      "start": 845.44,
      "end": 846.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Bye.",
      "trans": "拜。",
      "start": 846.44,
      "end": 847.44
    }
  ]
